#%Module1.0

module-whatis       "Molecular visualization system designed for rendering and analyzing 3D structures of biological macromolecules"
module-url          "https://github.com/schrodinger/pymol-open-source"
module-license      "https://github.com/schrodinger/pymol-open-source?tab=License-1-ov-file"
module-maintainer   "João Pedro Agostinho de Sousa <joao.agostinho-de-sousa@psi.ch>"

module-help         "
PyMOL is an open-source, user-sponsored molecular visualization software which
can produce high quality 3D images of biological macromolecules, such as
proteins. Also, it has several functions for manipulating structures and some
basic functions to analyze their chemical properties. A large percentage of the
figures in journal publications reporting new macromolecular structures are
created using PyMOL.
"

# Add conda env bin directory to PATH
prepend-path PATH "${PREFIX}/miniforge/envs/${P}_${V_PKG}/bin"

